text:
What did we just collect?

html`&lt;table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:0.95em;"&gt;
  &lt;caption class="visually-hidden"&gt;This table grounds the discussion of variable types in what was actually just collected — name, reaction time, device, and caffeine — showing each one's type and scale.&lt;/caption&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
    &lt;tr style="background:#1a1a2e;color:white;"&gt;
      &lt;th scope="col" style="padding:12px 20px;text-align:left;"&gt;Variable&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th scope="col" style="padding:12px 20px;text-align:left;"&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th scope="col" style="padding:12px 20px;text-align:left;"&gt;Scale&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th scope="col" style="padding:12px 20px;text-align:left;"&gt;Example values&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
    &lt;tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"&gt;
      &lt;td style="padding:12px 20px;font-weight:600;"&gt;Name&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td style="padding:12px 20px;"&gt;Categorical&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td style="padding:12px 20px;"&gt;Nominal&lt;/td&gt;
