Causal maps
A DAG (directed acyclic graph) is a diagram of assumptions: nodes are variables, arrows are effects.

html`&lt;div style="text-align:center;padding-top:20px;"&gt;
  &lt;svg width="420" height="120"&gt;
    &lt;text x="60" y="65" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;X&lt;/text&gt;
