    &lt;text x="200" y="45" font-size="20" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c0392b" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;?&lt;/text&gt;
    &lt;defs&gt;&lt;marker id="arrow" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"&gt;&lt;path d="M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z" fill="#2d6a4f"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;
  &lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;`






The causal question, drawn as simply as possible: does \(X\) affect \(Y\)? The arrow with a question mark is what the rest of this week tries to resolve.

Case one: a confounder

html`&lt;div style="text-align:center;padding-top:10px;"&gt;
  &lt;svg width="460" height="180"&gt;
    &lt;text x="80" y="150" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;X&lt;/text&gt;
    &lt;text x="380" y="150" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;Y&lt;/text&gt;
    &lt;text x="230" y="35" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;Z&lt;/text&gt;
    &lt;line x1="95" y1="140" x2="365" y2="140" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#a5)"/&gt;
    &lt;line x1="215" y1="45" x2="100" y2="130" stroke="#2d6a4f" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#a5)"/&gt;
    &lt;line x1="245" y1="45" x2="365" y2="130" stroke="#2d6a4f" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#a5)"/&gt;
    &lt;defs&gt;&lt;marker id="a5" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"&gt;&lt;path d="M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z" fill="#2d6a4f"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;
  &lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;`






\(Z\) sits upstream of \(X\) — it causes both \(X\) and \(Y\). Leave it out, and part of \(Z\)’s effect on \(Y\) gets misread as \(X\)’s.

The rule: control for it. This is Week 6’s omitted variable bias, drawn as a picture instead of a formula.

Case two: a mediator

html`&lt;div style="text-align:center;padding-top:20px;"&gt;
  &lt;svg width="480" height="140"&gt;
    &lt;text x="50" y="75" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;X&lt;/text&gt;
    &lt;text x="240" y="35" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;M&lt;/text&gt;
    &lt;text x="430" y="75" font-size="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"&gt;Y&lt;/text&gt;
    &lt;line x1="65" y1="65" x2="225" y2="40" stroke="#2d6a4f" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/&gt;
    &lt;line x1="255" y1="40" x2="415" y2="65" stroke="#2d6a4f" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/&gt;
    &lt;line x1="70" y1="75" x2="410" y2="75" stroke="#999" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4,3" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/&gt;
    &lt;defs&gt;
      &lt;marker id="arrow2" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"&gt;&lt;path d="M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z" fill="#2d6a4f"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;
      &lt;marker id="arrow3" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"&gt;&lt;path d="M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z" fill="#999"/&gt;&lt;/marker&gt;
